WEBVTT

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.170
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.660
Go! Shock!!

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.320
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:36.250
Friends who share the same future

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.780
With you guys

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.720
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:44.590
If we join forces

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:47.510
We’ll be invincible

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:50.530
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:58.070
Delicious food gives life

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:03.940
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:06.000
Let’s eat!!

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.960
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:12.180
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.400
We’re gonna win it!!
 Shock! Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.420
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:24.030
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:28.180
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:30.990
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.010
For the sake of tomorrow

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.470
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:46.070
Toriko and Komatsu Embark on a New Voyage!

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.430
Come on, then.

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:57.430
I'll show you everything.

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:05.270
The power of all life!

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:28.790
What ominous electromagnetic waves!

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:34.340
I'll cook you with these hands!

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.070
Toriko!

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:55.190
Foolish human!

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:58.570
There's... no way...

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:02.420
...you can... control...

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:05.170
...a hypertrophied... appetite!

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:27.820
That's...

00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:31.680
Hurry up...

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.580
...and throw your heart away!

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:37.860
Life is no more than...

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:38.760
...a tool!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.880
Ingredients he's eaten in the past!

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.860
You!

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:15.100
This power of mine...

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:19.800
...is made up of countless lives!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:23.540
Satanic Smash!

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:24.850
Fork!

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:30.520
Knife!

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:48.090
You don't value food,

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:52.170
life or heart...

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:56.580
Ain't no way I'm gonna lose to you!

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:02.190
Countless lives, you say?

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:12.520
In that case, I'll cook all of you

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:15.830
with these hands!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.760
Toriko!!

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:26.230
God's Cooking

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:31.580
Absolute Heart Life Slice!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:42.570
I give thanks...

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:46.720
...for all this world's...

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:49.570
...great bounty...

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:52.160
...life and heart...

00:05:54.170 --> 00:05:55.400
Beautiful...

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:58.070
Time to eat!

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:11.780
Heart!

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:14.070
Infinite...

00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:21.090
...Spiked Punch!!

00:06:30.110 --> 00:06:33.440
Life!

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:37.010
This is the infinite power

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:40.950
that life possesses!

00:07:13.770 --> 00:07:15.380
T-This is...

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:21.250
Yeah. The curtain is rising on the 
young generation and a new age.

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:28.900
Thank you for the meal.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:46.940
Toriko-san!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.350
Komatsu...

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:53.400
Toriko-san! Thank goodness!

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.850
Komatsu... Thank you.

00:07:57.490 --> 00:07:58.420
That's...

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:00.390
...Meteor Spice!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:08.170
Did something happen to President Ichiryu?

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:09.930
What in the world does this mean?

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:13.740
What is that?!

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:30.320
Did I make your fist lose its way?

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.080
At the bottom of your heart...

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:35.990
...there's still a little bit of love left.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.470
Midora...

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.330
You don't have to cry anymore.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:46.320
It's all too late.

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:49.910
Meteor Spice will make everything

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:52.240
in the Human World end.

00:08:52.600 --> 00:08:55.150
No. It won't end yet.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:59.710
There are young ones.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:03.960
I'm sure Toriko and the others will...

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:23.340
I really need to shampoo my hair, 
so don't expect too much...

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:25.120
We've got to do something.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:28.840
Fine. But I don't got much voice left.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:31.420
Sunny-san! Coco-san! Zebra-san!

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:35.890
A ton of things are coming down!

00:09:36.610 --> 00:09:38.960
Let's break through our limits!

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:39.890
Yeah!

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:42.410
Fork Shield!

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:44.600
Poison Shield!

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.500
Super Spatula!

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.300
Sound Wall!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:41.970
It's stopped...

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:44.660
Thank goodness!

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:47.590
Midora-sama... I have to get back.

00:10:48.560 --> 00:10:49.720
Excuse me...

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:53.250
Would you give Take-chan a message?

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.600
Tell him that at the next Fest,

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:58.360
I want to fight fair and square with him

00:10:58.360 --> 00:11:00.670
and Ume-chan, all three of us!

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:02.710
The next Fest, you say?

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:03.440
Yes!

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:05.310
Tell him yourself.

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:08.910
Tell Otake directly.

00:11:09.420 --> 00:11:10.950
Let him hear it from your own mouth.

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:13.500
Come to the Gourmet World.

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:15.350
I will!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.420
Toriko, I'll be waiting for you.

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:24.230
Yeah. We'll finish our 
fight in the Gourmet World.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:35.860
So IGO has been destroyed too...

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:39.660
I don't believe it, 
Shige-san and Uumen too...

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.110
Are you okay?

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:45.150
Komatsu-kun is making delicious food.

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:48.190
Eat that and then have a nice long rest.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:49.080
I can't.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.720
I can't just lie here.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:55.190
If we don't restore the Human World,

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.360
everyone will starve.

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:00.820
We need to distribute food, and fast!

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:02.800
Chief Mansom...

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.200
Did you just call me "handsome"?

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:07.220
Y-Yeah.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:09.470
I did! I said "handsome".

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:12.400
You said "handsome" again!

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:14.520
Hey, Chief Handsome!

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:17.250
I heard "handsome" again!

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:21.190
I don't believe it...

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:23.740
Midora!

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:25.640
This is the guy...

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:27.860
Old man!

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:29.590
Toriko, wait!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.060
So you're Toriko, eh?

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:37.450
There's no value in killing 
a decrepit old man.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:46.240
Midora, wait!

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:50.650
How about eating before you go?

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:52.520
What?

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.360
I'm sure you depleted your strength

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:57.690
during the battle with Ichi-chan, right?

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:00.100
Eat before you go...

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:03.270
...Midora.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:04.990
Old man!

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:08.400
Yes, by all means!

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.670
Although given the circumstances...

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.970
...there's only simple soup.

00:13:28.920 --> 00:13:29.850
Come on...

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:32.420
...little brother.

00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:40.260
We give thanks for all 
this world's great bounty.

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:42.510
Let's eat!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:06.120
Now fill up.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:10.530
Delicious!

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:15.140
Don't be shy. Have some more.

00:14:17.360 --> 00:14:19.870
This is really good too!

00:14:21.640 --> 00:14:25.580
The way you eat, you got a 
bright future ahead of you.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:32.120
This is delicious too!

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:36.470
Come on. You better eat more 
or you'll never beat me.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.820
Is it good?

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:45.720
I'm glad. We've still got a lot more.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:47.870
Eat until you're filled up.

00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:59.140
This is good...

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.150
I can feel my wounds healing.

00:15:02.370 --> 00:15:05.360
Yeah. This warmth...

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:08.950
It soothes the heart too.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:22.800
I didn't think we'd ever get to 
share another meal together...

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:25.490
I've lived to a ripe old age.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:29.410
Thank you for the meal.

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:34.010
You're leaving?

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:36.010
To the Gourmet World.

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:40.080
I can't ignore NEO.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:45.910
That was good.

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:56.100
Great! Thank you!

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.030
Farewell.

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:03.370
Sometime

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.750
let's sit around the table again...

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:08.510
...and eat together.

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:23.460
It's been three months since 
the mysterious meteorites fell.

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.460
Three Months After the 
Mysterious Meteorite Strike

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:27.540
Reconstruction efforts proceed, with 
Gourmet Hunters capturing ingredients

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.230
and delivering them all over.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:33.160
Who wants to eat this?

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.480
That's our Zonge-sama! What a big heart!

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:37.240
That's a little too, uh, compact.

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:38.500
Ow!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:41.120
You dare bite me?!

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:42.990
That guy's gotta be the "last boss"!

00:16:42.990 --> 00:16:44.100
Wow...

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:44.250
It's not!

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:47.810
And then the ingredients that 
the Gourmet Hunters bring back

00:16:47.810 --> 00:16:49.620
are cooked by the chefs

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:52.190
and shared with people all over the world.

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:54.630
Many hardships have been overcome

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:57.990
and smiles have returned to people's faces.

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:01.750
This has been the Gourmet News.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.650
Alright! Let's go!

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:08.470
Let's get a heaping helping 
of a gourmet scoop!

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:11.380
The Gourmet World...

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:14.980
Incredibly strong Beasts live there, right?

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.540
That ain't all.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:20.290
Joie and the rest of NEO are there too.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:21.620
Joie is...

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.990
Yeah. Still alive...

00:17:25.150 --> 00:17:28.070
The chef with the form and skills of Froese.

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:31.000
An enigma for sure, but 
I can tell you one thing.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.240
We can't afford to let 'em...

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:37.240
any of 'em... have GOD.

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:44.240
Everything is going according to plan.

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.720
Let's go!

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:51.550
First we obtain GOD and then go beyond...

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:56.850
...to a new Gourmet utopia!

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:59.690
Move out, NEO!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.070
Come to think of it,

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.600
where are Coco-san, Sunny-san, and Zebra-san?

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.570
They've already left for the Gourmet World.

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.210
A sea of deadly poison, eh?

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:17.700
Not surprising...

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:19.740
...for the Gourmet World.

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:23.570
This is tougher than anything.

00:18:24.070 --> 00:18:26.000
But it's beautiful.

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:33.960
What the hell kinda environment is this?

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.780
Cocky bastard...

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:41.580
I'm sure we'll meet up with 
'em in the Gourmet World.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:42.930
And when we do,

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:46.520
we'll sit down and eat together.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:49.010
All of us, with Acacia's Full Course.

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:50.250
Right!

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:55.720
But will I be able to handle 
the Gourmet World too?

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:57.830
Act now and it's your lucky day!

00:18:57.830 --> 00:19:00.910
"Wait until tomorrow, and luck 
will never come your way!"

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:02.830
Right, Toriko-san?

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.170
And so...

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:05.720
...let's go!

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:10.660
We have to jump down?!

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:16.550
Come, Toriko!

00:19:21.950 --> 00:19:24.070
I could see the River Styx...

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:26.550
I'm surprised you're still alive!

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:29.240
Overcoming various challenges 
hasn't been for nothin'!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.050
I could've died from that?!

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:34.390
Come on, go easier on me!

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:37.300
The Gourmet World proper is just ahead of us.

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:40.260
I-I'm totally nervous...

00:19:40.260 --> 00:19:44.160
There are terrifying Beasts, right?

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:45.210
I suppose...

00:19:46.010 --> 00:19:50.170
Maybe your Gourmet Luck will keep 
drawing those awesome Beasts to us!

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:52.600
D-Don't talk like that!

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.140
There it is!

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:01.850
There's another one!

00:20:18.930 --> 00:20:21.840
Sorry. We're passin' through.

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.000
Gourmet World Beasts

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:28.910
listened to Toriko-san.

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:35.480
I wonder what kind of delicious food awaits.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:38.220
I can't wait to see more 
of the Gourmet World!

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:41.620
I'm gonna capture GOD for sure!

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:42.780
Right!

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:45.060
Let's go, Komatsu!

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:46.920
Okay, Toriko-san!

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:51.890
Someone once said...

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:56.050
There is a Gourmet Hunter who 
captures and is grateful for

00:20:56.050 --> 00:21:03.240
all the bountiful ingredients of this world.

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:04.850
There is a chef who spreads happiness

00:21:04.850 --> 00:21:10.820
and puts a smile on everyone's 
face wherever he goes.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:16.310
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:24.340
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:30.070
Toriko: The Human World Arc
The End

00:21:36.640 --> 00:21:42.320
Even in a world that nobody's ever seen

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:47.900
There's something that can be 
glimpsed if you keep chasing dreams

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:53.600
Flowers don't bloom on top of asphalt

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:58.760
Come on, let's go make 
only your dreams come true

00:21:58.760 --> 00:22:04.500
Mega Raba! The map that you 
draw spreads out into infinity

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:10.280
Mega Raba! Nobody can stop you

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:16.340
Mega Raba! Let's go forth, 
feeling excitement in our hearts

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:21.680
Let's go find what you've been longing for

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:22.900
Mega Raba

00:22:24.700 --> 00:22:25.740
Mega Raba

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:28.780
Mega Raba
